</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000021F2007X_04_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___000045K00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Transmission Revolution Sensor (NT)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the transmission revolution sensor (NT) connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C160034J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminals.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1(NT-) - 2(NT+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>560 to 680Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000021F2007X_04_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000021F2007X_04_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000021F2007X_04_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___000045L00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness or Connector (Transmission Revolution Sensor (NT) - Engine Control Computer)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For wire harness and connector inspection procedures and precautions, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D701ZX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the engine control computer.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C130768J03" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal of the engine control computer and the revolution sensor (NT) vehicle side connectors. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000FSD00RX"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Name)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A126(NT+) - 2(NT+)</ptxt>
</entry>
